Subject: [PATCH] urlmon: say when a protocol handler is out of reach

跨 apartment 取到的协议处理器不能被聚合，而退回去单独问它要
IInternetProtocol 又需要该接口的封送支持。两件事都失败时，绑定会在很远的地方
以一个光秃秃的 E_NOINTERFACE 结束，日志里没有任何线索指向 apartment。

实测：同一段代码在 STA 下绑定 about:blank 成功，在 MTA 下
IClassFactory::CreateInstance 带 outer 返回 CLASS_E_NOAGGREGATION（这是正确的
COM 行为），随后不带 outer 要 IInternetProtocol 返回 E_NOINTERFACE。
CLSID_HTMLDocument 与 mshtml 的 AboutProtocol 都注册为 ThreadingModel=Apartment。

这里只补一行诊断，不改行为：真正的修复需要给这些接口提供 proxy/stub，
不属于本补丁。

---
diff --git a/dlls/urlmon/bindprot.c b/dlls/urlmon/bindprot.c
index 0a7afc7..5102d3a 100644
--- a/dlls/urlmon/bindprot.c
+++ b/dlls/urlmon/bindprot.c
@@ -512,8 +512,17 @@ static HRESULT WINAPI BindProtocol_StartEx(IInternetProtocolEx *iface, IUri *pUr
             else
                 IUnknown_Release(protocol_unk);
         }
-        else if(hres == CLASS_E_NOAGGREGATION)
+        else if(hres == CLASS_E_NOAGGREGATION) {
+            /* A handler reached through a cross-apartment proxy cannot be
+             * aggregated, and asking that proxy for IInternetProtocol needs
+             * marshalling the interface does not have.  Without this the bind
+             * fails far from here as a bare E_NOINTERFACE, with nothing saying
+             * the apartment is why. */
             hres = IClassFactory_CreateInstance(cf, NULL, &IID_IInternetProtocol, (void**)&protocol);
+            if(FAILED(hres))
+                WARN("protocol handler for %s not usable from this apartment: %08lx\n",
+                     debugstr_w(This->display_uri), hres);
+        }
 
         IClassFactory_Release(cf);
         if(FAILED(hres))
